 "strings": {
  "Even more than Kopi Luwak?": "",
  "That depends on who you ask... What's clear is that it's also one of the most expensive beans you can buy.": "",
  "Not to mention the Esmeralda Special, which is sometimes put up on auction...": "",
  "That too is difficult to procure. I myself have only tried it once in this long life of mine...": "",
  "All the same, the Geisha 1500 is yet another derivative of Geisha coffee that's reserved in a private collection...": "",
  "(Great. I bet he's gonna keep on talking forever...)": "",
  "And that concludes this topic. Coffee is truly a fascinating subject indeed.": "",
  "(I had to listen to him for 40 minutes straight...)": "",
  "Um. What is Sagara-san doing on the floor?": "",
  "Oh, he just passed out.": "",
  "Is he okay?": "",
  "Oh yeah. Earlier he said he obtained a rare Geisha from the auction house.": "",
  "He gave it a tiny little sniff, then fainted because apparently it smelled so good.": "",
  "...I think he might want to get that checked out.": "",
  "Seems like you were in quite the pickle when the Keihin Gang came after you.": "",
  "Yeah. They put a 10 million yen bounty on me.": "",
  "10 million yen... I could go on a coffee garden vacation with money like that...": "",
  "Um. What?": "",
  "O-Oh, pardon my manners. Money corrupts the mind of men.": "",
  "I'm glad you didn't come after me...": "",
  "Huh? Ayumu-kun, what are you doing here?": "",
  "Playing hide-and-seek.": "",
  "Again? Does your dad know?": "",
  "Yeah! We play this together now!": "",
  "That's good to hear.": "",
  "It's okay to play hide-and-seek, but I'm not sure this is the right place to do it.": "",
  "Come on, it's safe here.": "",
  "Yes, please enjoy your time here. Perhaps you would like some delicious coffee...": "",
  "Hey, mister! Don't tell my dad that I'm hiding here, okay?": "",
  "Okay, I won't.": "",
  "To be honest, I don't understand expensive coffee at all.": "",
  "That's because you haven't trained enough.": "",
  "I heard this thing called \"third wave coffee\" is trending.": "",
  "That's just hand-drip coffee, right? Wouldn't we qualify as third wave coffee, then?": "",
  "Why are coffee beans so expensive, anyway? Blue Mountain's like 2,000 yen for only 100 grams.": "",
  "Yeah, it's way too expensive. Wouldn't you agree?": "",
  "Is my face really that big...?": "",
  "Shogi, huh? Nice.": "",
  "Puzzle shogi?": "",
  "(I just realized, I don't have that much on me... In order to have a good time, I should have at least 50,000 yen.)": "",
  "(Now where can I get that kind of money...)": "",
  "(What should we talk about...)": "",
  "(I still haven't gotten a good picture.)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's good to hear.": "ดีใจที่ได้ยินแบบนั้นค่ะ",
  "Okay, I won't.": "โอเคค่ะ หนูจะไม่ตามไปแล้ว"
 }
}
